<h1>window_get_height</h1>
<p>With this function you can get the current height (in pixels) of the game window.</p>
<p class="note"><span data-conref="../../../../assets/snippets/Tag_note.hts"><span class="note">NOTE</span></span> On GX.games, this returns the height of the browser area.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Syntax:</h4>
<p class="code">window_get_height();</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Returns:</h4>
<p class="code"><span data-keyref="Type_Real"><a target="_blank" href="../../../GML_Overview/Data_Types.htm">Real</a></span></p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Example:</h4>
<p class="code">hh = window_get_height();</p>
<p>The above code will store the current window height in the variable &quot;hh&quot;.</p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>
